    "abilities": "Superior Regeneration(Heals 1d6 points of non-fire/acid damage per 10 seconds to all body areas. Dies if head is destroyed or seperated from the heart.), Corporeal Posession(Can posses physical forms lacking spirit and soul. Must make a Control Resistance to do so. Fail = no further attempts. For the first 30 minutes(-1 minute per WIL) control of the new form is at -1/-5% to all physical actions. Duration of possession varies. Mindless Husks: 1 Week per WIL. Control Resistance once per week at -5% cumulative or be rejected. Humanoid Corpse: -5% Control Resist for each hour it has already been dead. Once possessed. Lasts 1 Day per WIL. Control Resistance once per day at -5% cumulative or be rejected. Animal Corpse: -5% Control Resist for each 10 minutes it has already been dead. Once possessed. Lasts 10 minutes per WIL. Control Resistance once per 10 minutes at -5% cumulative or be rejected.)",
    "disabilities": "Infertile(Lacks ability to reproduce.), Non-Corporeal(No physical form.), Detached Psyche(Being's soul, holds the spirit, which holds the mind without a body. Dependent on the possession of other physical forms. Survives unharmed outside a body for 1 hour per WIL. Thereafter must make a Control Resistance. Every failure is -1 WIL. Every failure requires a WIL Save to avoid insanity. Without a form, WIL losses continue without recovery until death at 0 WIL.)",
    "immunities": "Control(Cannot be controlled.)"
  },
